* {{PropertyData|Oś|Vector}}: (read-only)
* {{PropertyData|Kąt|Angle}}
* {{PropertyData|Kąt2|Angle}}
* {{PropertyData|Do powierzchni|LinkSub}}
* {{PropertyData|Oś odniesienia|LinkSub}}
* {{PropertyData|Rzutowanie osi|Bool}}: rzutuje oś odniesienia na płaszczyznę profilu, zobacz [[#Opcje|Opcje]]. {{Version/pl|26.3}}
</div>

{{TitleProperty|Projekt Części}}

See [[PartDesign_Pocket|PartDesign Pocket]].

{{TitleProperty|Side1}}

* {{PropertyData|Type|Enumeration}}: {{Value|Angle}}, {{Value|ThroughAll}}, {{Value|UpToFirst}} or {{Value|UpToFace}}. Do not use {{Value|?TwoAngles}}. Defines how the groove will end.
* {{PropertyData|Angle|Angle}}: The angle of the groove.
* {{PropertyData|Up To Face|LinkSub}}: Face where the groove will end.
* {{PropertyData|Up To Shape|LinkSubList}}: Not used.

{{TitleProperty|Side2}}

The properties in this group are only editable if {{PropertyData|Side Type}} is {{Value|Two sides}}. See the '''Side1''' group for more information about the properties.

